WEBVTT

00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:35.400
This can't be happening; I clasp my head in my hands

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:41.990
As I struggle with my desire to escape from this saturated world.

00:00:42.830 --> 00:00:47.420
Time goes flowing past with the rustling roar of sand.

00:00:47.420 --> 00:00:50.840
Things never get any better.

00:00:50.840 --> 00:00:53.760
I'm gazing on toward a dreamless tomorrow.

00:00:55.550 --> 00:01:01.060
I want to bid farewell to my days of constantly feeling lost.

00:01:02.060 --> 00:01:06.520
I try stretching out my hand in resistance.

00:01:06.520 --> 00:01:12.280
We'll cry millions upon millions of tears, then be reborn.

00:01:12.280 --> 00:01:18.410
Let's keep going, with red in our eyes, toward the future we drew for ourselves.

00:01:18.410 --> 00:01:24.160
Come over to me; I'm clapping my hands.

00:01:24.160 --> 00:01:26.120
Who are you? Where are you coming from?

00:01:26.120 --> 00:01:30.460
I strain my eyes in the darkness.

00:01:30.460 --> 00:01:36.050
I can't see a thing, and nothing makes sense, but I'll go anyway.

00:01:36.050 --> 00:01:42.560
To the place where you're waiting, lit by a beacon of light.

00:01:53.050 --> 00:01:56.320
It seems stuff like this gets uploaded a lot lately.

00:01:57.900 --> 00:01:59.850
This one, this one, and that one too...

00:01:59.850 --> 00:02:01.770
...all of them are posted by Full Circle.

00:02:01.770 --> 00:02:04.190
"The world is one circle", is what they say.

00:02:04.190 --> 00:02:06.290
I-I wouldn't know anything about that!

00:02:08.910 --> 00:02:13.780
Recently, these bastard hackers have been targeting JJ Systems.

00:02:14.450 --> 00:02:16.910
They've been leaking the company's accounting documents,

00:02:16.910 --> 00:02:20.430
and invading Chairman Kaishou Rinroku's private affairs.

00:02:24.610 --> 00:02:27.660
You can use an automated monitoring
system to take all this down, can't you?

00:02:27.660 --> 00:02:30.440
Yes, but there are people who can get around that as well.

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:32.440
Just like with a certain song.

00:02:35.730 --> 00:02:38.470
Did you think they hadn't noticed?

00:02:38.470 --> 00:02:40.490
The Joint Coordinating Dept. knows.

00:02:42.230 --> 00:02:43.740
I'm sure you understand too.

00:02:44.310 --> 00:02:45.870
Bettennou is dangerous.

00:02:46.690 --> 00:02:49.160
She takes the words of a specific
human being and makes them reality...

00:02:49.160 --> 00:02:52.210
...or at the very least, has the ability to make it appear that way.

00:03:01.750 --> 00:03:04.430
It seems Bettennou has escaped.

00:03:05.750 --> 00:03:07.600
Why did you come all the way here?

00:03:08.130 --> 00:03:12.480
I'm sure you aren't intending to attain Bettennou for yourself.

00:03:13.470 --> 00:03:16.930
The police, as well as Kaishou, are searching for her whereabouts.

00:03:16.930 --> 00:03:19.240
We have to find her before them and...

00:03:19.240 --> 00:03:21.530
What are we going to do once we find her?

00:03:22.560 --> 00:03:23.690
Well...

00:03:23.690 --> 00:03:27.940
If what you're saying about her is true, Bettennou isn't human...

00:03:27.940 --> 00:03:30.900
...and also hasn't committed any crimes.

00:03:31.530 --> 00:03:33.400
She has committed crimes!

00:03:34.030 --> 00:03:34.790
I mean...

00:03:34.790 --> 00:03:38.670
Shinjuurou... we should stay away from her...

00:03:39.240 --> 00:03:40.410
Inga...

00:03:40.990 --> 00:03:43.180
Shinjuurou-sama, you have an e-mail.

00:03:50.800 --> 00:03:52.640
I can't believe this.

00:03:52.640 --> 00:03:55.440
We've already put up the "breaking news" notice...

00:03:55.800 --> 00:03:58.070
Where the hell is Kaishou-sensei?

00:03:59.600 --> 00:04:03.570
Um... Something else just went up from Full Circle.

00:04:06.770 --> 00:04:08.450
Can I watch anime?

00:04:08.450 --> 00:04:12.440
It seems that Kaishou Rinroku is about to appear on television.

00:04:14.610 --> 00:04:18.460
That extraordinary man is going to make a surprise live appearance on our program.

00:04:18.990 --> 00:04:21.450
Chairman Kaishou Rinroku, of JJ Systems,

00:04:21.450 --> 00:04:26.830
has been working hard to restore the telephone and internet systems that were targeted during the war,

00:04:26.830 --> 00:04:30.970
while simultaneously solving many cases as an adviser to the police.

00:04:30.970 --> 00:04:35.550
Kaishou personally requested to attend,
eager to express his views on today's topic,

00:04:35.550 --> 00:04:37.980
"Legislation for nationalising the energy industry".

00:04:38.480 --> 00:04:39.980
And we're in commercial break!

00:04:41.180 --> 00:04:44.310
Just now, a strange message was
posted under the "Full Circle" handle!

00:04:44.310 --> 00:04:47.390
It's spreading all over BBS's and social networks!

00:04:48.730 --> 00:04:51.940
Oh, this one? I see.

00:04:51.940 --> 00:04:54.870
It seems our lives are in danger.

00:04:55.200 --> 00:04:56.150
Huh?

00:04:58.030 --> 00:05:02.130
"Why is that Kaishou Rinroku going to appear on television?"

00:05:02.620 --> 00:05:08.200
"The truth is that also appearing are
politicians who have criticised JJ Systems,

00:05:08.200 --> 00:05:10.300
the owner of a rival company, and the author of an exposé...

00:05:10.300 --> 00:05:13.020
...in other words, many enemies of Kaishou Rinroku."

00:05:13.250 --> 00:05:18.090
C-Could it be that the reason he asked to come on the show today was...

00:05:18.090 --> 00:05:19.430
Hey, c'mon!

00:05:19.430 --> 00:05:25.520
Are you trying to say that someone like Kaishou Rinroku would murder us on a public television program?

00:05:25.520 --> 00:05:27.280
Speaking of Full Circle,

00:05:27.680 --> 00:05:30.890
wasn't it recently revealed that your station was...

00:05:30.890 --> 00:05:34.660
...churning out lies for the government during the war?

00:05:35.820 --> 00:05:38.920
Well, that doesn't really have anything to do with this...

00:05:38.920 --> 00:05:41.490
So where's Mr. Kaishou?

00:05:41.490 --> 00:05:42.920
Is he really coming?

00:05:43.390 --> 00:05:46.670
I wonder if he even exists in the first place.

00:05:48.080 --> 00:05:51.220
Chairman Kaishou has arrived!

00:05:52.250 --> 00:05:54.100
Chairman!

00:05:54.100 --> 00:05:55.670
I'm so sorry.

00:05:55.670 --> 00:05:57.590
It has been a while since I've taken the train;

00:05:57.590 --> 00:05:59.130
I had no idea where to transfer.

00:05:59.130 --> 00:06:00.560
Y-You took the train?

00:06:03.550 --> 00:06:05.810
Well, shall we get started?

00:06:05.810 --> 00:06:07.320
Time for a heated discussion!

00:06:10.570 --> 00:06:15.110
Milady, the master's program is going to start soon!

00:06:15.110 --> 00:06:16.450
Not interested!

00:06:16.900 --> 00:06:18.990
There you go again!

00:06:18.990 --> 00:06:21.630
You're probably planning to sneak off and watch it anyway!

00:06:22.410 --> 00:06:24.320
What am I, a cockroach?

00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:33.260
He sure looks good on camera! Damn him!

00:06:34.040 --> 00:06:35.640
Entering commercial break.

00:06:38.380 --> 00:06:39.720
Chairman Kaishou!

00:06:39.720 --> 00:06:41.260
I'll be right back.

00:06:41.260 --> 00:06:42.380
I have a phone call...

00:06:42.380 --> 00:06:43.650
...it's just from home.

00:06:43.650 --> 00:06:45.400
Unbelievable!

00:06:46.760 --> 00:06:49.220
I wonder if he's discussing a plan to kill us all.

00:06:49.220 --> 00:06:51.910
Yeah, and then suddenly, boom!

00:06:59.110 --> 00:07:00.440
Father?

00:07:07.370 --> 00:07:10.040
You know I'm not good with machines.

00:07:10.040 --> 00:07:12.180
I couldn't even tell you the difference between a crack or a hack...

00:07:12.540 --> 00:07:15.920
Then why is Full Circle targeting Chairman Kaishou?

00:07:15.920 --> 00:07:17.930
They're disclosing far too much information.

00:07:18.240 --> 00:07:20.130
Your companion isn't with you today?

00:07:20.130 --> 00:07:21.260
It's a public holiday.

00:07:21.260 --> 00:07:22.940
I even had to drive myself today...

00:07:23.420 --> 00:07:25.090
Don't change the subject!

00:07:27.800 --> 00:07:29.510
I'm on site...

00:07:29.510 --> 00:07:32.150
No way! And... What about the Chairman?!

00:07:32.600 --> 00:07:34.160
Is Chairman Kaishou all right?!

00:07:38.560 --> 00:07:40.730
The station's server is down.

00:07:40.730 --> 00:07:42.670
The fixed cameras nearby are...

00:08:07.890 --> 00:08:10.400
Run! Quickly, move it!

00:08:26.530 --> 00:08:29.450
Someone may call the house, so don't leave!

00:08:29.450 --> 00:08:30.500
Keep checking e-mails as well!

00:08:30.500 --> 00:08:32.330
Y-Yes ma'am... But...

00:08:32.330 --> 00:08:33.010
I'm counting on you!

00:08:33.010 --> 00:08:36.010
Stay here, Rie.

00:08:37.370 --> 00:08:38.510
Father?!

00:08:38.830 --> 00:08:41.210
But... The live show...

00:08:41.210 --> 00:08:44.630
I had them allow me to do it from home via webcam.

00:08:44.630 --> 00:08:45.890
I'm going to go check things out over there.

00:08:47.130 --> 00:08:50.230
But... They said it was a live appearance...

00:08:53.930 --> 00:08:55.110
Stop screwing around!

00:08:55.110 --> 00:08:57.770
All you have to say is, "He's not here"?!

00:08:57.770 --> 00:08:59.490
Prosecutor! Over there!

00:09:06.900 --> 00:09:08.000
Chairman...

00:09:15.870 --> 00:09:17.590
Um...

00:09:17.590 --> 00:09:19.870
Hospital, hospital...

00:09:38.730 --> 00:09:41.230
As many as eight people have been reported dead or missing,

00:09:41.230 --> 00:09:44.940
among them are some of the participants of the live program.

00:09:44.940 --> 00:09:46.040
Staff from the hospital have stated...

00:09:46.040 --> 00:09:50.070
It's being said that there was a
confrontation between Kaishou Rinroku,

00:09:50.070 --> 00:09:52.420
and the severely injured Fuwa Juujirou, president of Sun Photoelectric.

00:09:52.780 --> 00:09:55.410
"Kaishou Rinroku will eliminate those who stand in his way."

00:09:55.410 --> 00:09:58.550
The predictions made by Full Circle were mysteriously true.

00:09:59.460 --> 00:10:00.960
I can't find him anywhere.

00:10:00.960 --> 00:10:03.560
And I found this on the ground.

00:10:04.790 --> 00:10:08.380
Inga, you idiot. What kind of detour are you taking?

00:10:09.310 --> 00:10:11.770
You're not allowed inside. You're not allowed, hear?!

00:10:11.770 --> 00:10:13.760
Why is the Public Security Force here?

00:10:13.760 --> 00:10:17.720
We've been dispatched as Chairman Kaishou's private guard.

00:10:17.720 --> 00:10:19.980
We accompanied him yesterday to the TV studio, but...

00:10:19.980 --> 00:10:21.160
...I never thought something like this could happen.

00:10:22.510 --> 00:10:23.910
Entry is prohibited.

00:10:25.480 --> 00:10:28.400
I have a fever. Maybe it's a cold...?

00:10:28.400 --> 00:10:29.900
Maybe even the flu...?

00:10:29.900 --> 00:10:31.860
I feel like I'm gonna collapse if I don't get some medicine!

00:10:31.860 --> 00:10:33.040
Defeated Detective!

00:10:33.700 --> 00:10:36.800
Are you sure it wasn't you who targeted Kaishou-sensei?

00:10:37.650 --> 00:10:40.800
I'm Mizuno, a commanding officer of the Public Security Force.

00:10:40.800 --> 00:10:42.790
And this is Mihara, one of my men.

00:10:42.790 --> 00:10:43.940
As long as we're here,

00:10:43.940 --> 00:10:46.720
you won't be able to get anywhere near Kaishou-sensei!

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:47.720
Yajima-san!

00:10:47.720 --> 00:10:49.960
You were just paying a visit to Chairman Kaishou, weren't you?

00:10:49.960 --> 00:10:52.100
Is it true that you're an old friend of his?

00:10:52.100 --> 00:10:57.510
If not for something this serious, he would be working 24/7...

00:10:57.510 --> 00:10:59.610
...this may be a great opportunity for a break.

00:10:59.930 --> 00:11:02.610
Do you think the criminal's target was Mr. Kaishou? Or...

00:11:03.850 --> 00:11:05.100
Yajima-san...

00:11:05.100 --> 00:11:07.320
There's no guarantee that it was an act of terrorism.

00:11:07.320 --> 00:11:09.440
The station itself was quite old, for that matter;

00:11:09.440 --> 00:11:12.750
I heard that it may have just been caused by a fire.

00:11:16.030 --> 00:11:18.410
Please let this person through.

00:11:18.410 --> 00:11:19.760
He's an acquaintance of the lady.

00:11:22.540 --> 00:11:24.120
Defeated Detective!

00:11:24.670 --> 00:11:28.170
To receive support from Yajima-san is a rare victory for you.

00:11:28.170 --> 00:11:30.760
But don't let it get to your head!

00:11:35.110 --> 00:11:37.610
Everything was exactly as Full Circle predicted!

00:11:38.140 --> 00:11:40.060
We were almost killed!

00:11:40.060 --> 00:11:41.950
And the criminal is inside here!

00:11:41.950 --> 00:11:46.100
If Chairman Kaishou had taken one
wrong step, he could have died as well!

00:11:46.100 --> 00:11:47.180
Of course!

00:11:47.180 --> 00:11:50.730
Since the second he walked outside of the studio, the explosion went off!

00:11:50.730 --> 00:11:51.580
Quite the coincidence!

00:11:51.940 --> 00:11:53.830
Who the hell is going to believe that?

00:11:54.150 --> 00:11:55.200
Ow!

00:11:55.740 --> 00:11:59.210
At the very least, I won't forgive him!

00:12:11.170 --> 00:12:12.980
I'm not going to visit him.

00:12:13.760 --> 00:12:17.980
It'd probably worsen his condition if you did.

00:12:18.800 --> 00:12:20.730
Then why did you call me here?

00:12:22.010 --> 00:12:23.270
I have a request.

00:12:24.410 --> 00:12:25.790
The cause of the explosion?

00:12:26.430 --> 00:12:28.850
Doesn't it seem like it was made by Kaishou Rinroku himself?

00:12:28.850 --> 00:12:30.480
Do you really think so?

00:12:30.480 --> 00:12:32.000
My father almost died.

00:12:35.900 --> 00:12:39.870
I certainly can't say that he's always done the right thing...

00:12:39.870 --> 00:12:43.410
...but to gather all the people who
disagree with him and try to kill them...

00:12:43.410 --> 00:12:45.450
He'd never do something so stupid.

00:12:46.080 --> 00:12:49.510
He'd craft a perfect crime, of which he'd never be suspected. Right?

00:12:49.960 --> 00:12:51.250
That's right!

00:12:53.550 --> 00:12:56.170
Don't tell me this is the payment for your request.

00:12:56.170 --> 00:12:57.380
It is.

00:13:16.400 --> 00:13:18.780
What did you talk to the young lady about?

00:13:18.780 --> 00:13:21.280
What do the police think?

00:13:21.280 --> 00:13:22.380
What was the cause of the explosion?

00:13:23.990 --> 00:13:26.580
The military has entered in on the investigation as well...

00:13:26.580 --> 00:13:28.890
It doesn't seem like it was a normal explosion.

00:13:33.340 --> 00:13:37.130
I can't believe I've been charged with proving Kaishou's innocence.

00:13:37.970 --> 00:13:40.650
Is Inga still lost?!

00:13:47.390 --> 00:13:49.160
Hold it right there!

00:13:49.160 --> 00:13:52.160
Not even Diet members are allowed through.

00:13:52.160 --> 00:13:53.560
Hey!

00:13:53.560 --> 00:13:56.620
There's no way they'd call a summons at a time like this!

00:13:57.940 --> 00:13:59.370
Diet?

00:14:00.610 --> 00:14:02.380
Ow...

00:14:05.080 --> 00:14:06.370
Thanks!

00:14:08.160 --> 00:14:09.460
You're a Diet member?

00:14:09.460 --> 00:14:12.330
I'm a first-year errand girl.

00:14:12.330 --> 00:14:14.790
I told them I'd be busy today,

00:14:14.790 --> 00:14:17.350
but they insisted I go and get Chairman Kaishou's testimony.

00:14:17.350 --> 00:14:20.850
You mean his testimony as a witness to yesterday's explosion?

00:14:21.970 --> 00:14:24.180
Oh, of course not!

00:14:24.930 --> 00:14:28.220
The internal information that Full Circle leaked the other day...

00:14:28.220 --> 00:14:30.610
...mentioned a system that could be appropriated for military use.

00:14:31.230 --> 00:14:33.350
Information from JJ Systems?

00:14:33.350 --> 00:14:38.230
We just want his statement that the system was designed for peaceful purposes.

00:14:38.230 --> 00:14:42.630
It's um... microwave transmissions, or something along those lines.

00:14:43.030 --> 00:14:45.380
The broadcast date has already been set for the story, so...

00:14:46.120 --> 00:14:47.950
He'll be out of commission for a while.

00:14:47.950 --> 00:14:48.950
I feel sorry for you.

00:14:48.950 --> 00:14:49.880
Ah-!

00:14:57.130 --> 00:14:58.020
Train?

00:14:58.350 --> 00:15:01.420
No! Train!

00:15:01.420 --> 00:15:04.220
Are you saying that Kaishou came here by train?

00:15:04.220 --> 00:15:08.350
Not at all! I said he came here by train!

00:15:11.310 --> 00:15:13.580
What was his demeanour once he arrived?

00:15:13.580 --> 00:15:17.520
We were all a bit nervous over the incident with Full Circle,

00:15:17.520 --> 00:15:18.790
but he seemed exceedingly calm.

00:15:19.440 --> 00:15:21.940
At the very least, he'd be nervous
about getting caught in the explosion,

00:15:21.940 --> 00:15:23.990
if he'd done something like that.

00:15:23.990 --> 00:15:26.410
Hey! Work that thing harder!

00:15:26.410 --> 00:15:28.240
Melt that damn microwave!

00:15:28.240 --> 00:15:30.090
I'll give it one more try!

00:15:30.540 --> 00:15:32.790
What is he doing?

00:15:32.790 --> 00:15:33.960
You don't know?

00:15:33.960 --> 00:15:36.100
It's all about microwaves, mi-cro-waves!

00:15:36.460 --> 00:15:39.470
They're talking about what happened yesterday all over the net.

00:15:40.340 --> 00:15:43.300
People are speculating that it was
caused by military-grade microwaves.

00:15:43.300 --> 00:15:45.070
If you put metal in a commercial microwave,

00:15:45.070 --> 00:15:47.390
it starts to crackle with electricity; following that same principle,

00:15:47.390 --> 00:15:49.990
people are wondering what would happen if it was superheated.

00:15:50.350 --> 00:15:53.890
People have been accusing the deterioration of our building as a cause of the explosion,

00:15:53.890 --> 00:15:55.740
so all I have to do is prove them wrong!

00:15:56.270 --> 00:15:58.520
All in all, pretty scientific, don't you think?

00:16:02.570 --> 00:16:08.500
It seems some people are saying that JJ Systems applied microwaves to cause the explosion.

00:16:08.950 --> 00:16:13.760
But there's no way he would have shot something like that directly at a building he was inside of.

00:16:15.410 --> 00:16:17.970
What?! I've finally proved his innocence!

00:16:19.080 --> 00:16:20.120
What?!

00:16:20.120 --> 00:16:21.960
What is it?!

00:16:21.960 --> 00:16:24.070
On that day... I saw...

00:16:24.070 --> 00:16:24.690
Saw what?

00:16:25.420 --> 00:16:28.690
My father... at home...

00:16:30.140 --> 00:16:34.780
Father wasn't at the TV station, he was at home.

00:16:35.150 --> 00:16:38.100
But later, I received a phone call from the hospital...

00:16:38.100 --> 00:16:40.950
...telling me that he had been injured at the TV station.

00:16:40.950 --> 00:16:44.150
The producer says my father was at the studio as well...

00:16:44.780 --> 00:16:46.540
It's like he has a doppelgänger!

00:16:47.110 --> 00:16:49.670
Or does that mean that someone dressed up to impersonate him?

00:16:51.530 --> 00:16:53.920
Why did you tell me this?

00:16:54.910 --> 00:16:56.330
I don't know...

00:16:59.120 --> 00:17:00.380
What's that for?

00:17:00.380 --> 00:17:02.430
I'm returning your fee.

00:17:10.760 --> 00:17:12.050
Mr. Detective!

00:17:14.220 --> 00:17:17.070
Do you think my father is the culprit?

00:17:27.500 --> 00:17:28.460
Dammit!

00:17:28.460 --> 00:17:30.250
Dammit! Dammit!

00:17:30.780 --> 00:17:33.760
What are you doing, Shinjuurou?

00:17:34.740 --> 00:17:35.760
Inga...

00:17:36.290 --> 00:17:37.870
You were back here?

00:17:39.540 --> 00:17:40.460
Inga!

00:17:40.460 --> 00:17:43.270
I've figured out where Bettennou is.

00:17:44.900 --> 00:17:46.640
A great number of people have testified...

00:17:46.640 --> 00:17:50.380
...that they saw Kaishou Rinroku in the TV station at the time of the explosion.

00:17:50.380 --> 00:17:54.020
But his own family claims that he was at home the same time.

00:17:54.020 --> 00:17:56.180
We've seen something like this happen before.

00:17:56.180 --> 00:17:57.530
Really?

00:17:58.020 --> 00:17:59.680
It's Bettennou.

00:17:59.680 --> 00:18:03.200
The believers of the Bettennou Society saw things that weren't there,

00:18:03.200 --> 00:18:05.400
and were even made to view illusions through a television screen.

00:18:05.940 --> 00:18:08.670
If we assume that the Kaishou who appeared at the TV station is...

00:18:08.670 --> 00:18:10.920
We accompanied him yesterday to the TV studio, but...

00:18:11.040 --> 00:18:13.670
I said he came here by train!

00:18:14.280 --> 00:18:16.170
It was an illusion, so the details don't line up.

00:18:17.330 --> 00:18:20.370
The day that Bettennou disappeared from the novelist's side,

00:18:20.370 --> 00:18:23.810
she was, in fact, still there.

00:18:24.460 --> 00:18:26.310
Just give it up already...

00:18:26.570 --> 00:18:31.310
If Kaishou were to say "Bettennou isn't here", then no one would be able to see her.

00:18:31.670 --> 00:18:34.570
Inga... Not even you.

00:18:34.570 --> 00:18:35.480
Damn!

00:18:36.010 --> 00:18:38.990
What are you angry about, Shinjuurou?

00:18:39.390 --> 00:18:44.440
Angry?! Using Bettennou, one can turn any lie into a truth!

00:18:44.440 --> 00:18:47.000
I can't believe that Kaishou was someone who would rely on such a thing!

00:18:47.480 --> 00:18:50.940
I even tried to prove his innocence!

00:18:50.940 --> 00:18:54.710
As long as you're thinking like that... You can't win.

00:18:58.220 --> 00:18:59.100
Inga...

00:18:59.100 --> 00:19:00.340
Leave him be!

00:19:02.080 --> 00:19:04.260
If that's how it's going to be,

00:19:05.540 --> 00:19:07.380
I'll just corner him so he can't escape.

00:19:11.380 --> 00:19:12.770
Ah, Kuramitsu-sensei?

00:19:13.430 --> 00:19:16.470
Yes, this is Yuuki Shinjuurou!

00:19:16.470 --> 00:19:19.280
I'm calling about the upcoming broadcast we spoke of before.

00:19:19.770 --> 00:19:23.250
Amidst all of this, Mr. Kaishou Rinroku was selected to submit a witness account...

00:19:23.250 --> 00:19:26.220
...for the National Diet's Budget Committee.

00:19:26.220 --> 00:19:28.290
This matter has nothing to do with the explosion...

00:19:28.730 --> 00:19:30.460
Diet member! Diet member Kuramitsu!

00:19:31.030 --> 00:19:34.400
We've heard from hospital staff that Kaishou himself requested the opportunity to testify.

00:19:34.400 --> 00:19:36.320
Does this suggest his innocence?

00:19:36.320 --> 00:19:39.920
Um... Well, I'm just a low-level member, so I don't know...

00:19:40.310 --> 00:19:43.190
Is it possible that the murder was caused by microwave generating satellites?

00:19:43.190 --> 00:19:47.130
The intent of our interview is to have him answer the concerns of foreign nations;

00:19:47.130 --> 00:19:49.460
we aren't even making considerations related to his suspicion of murder!

00:19:49.460 --> 00:19:50.750
Don't give me that crap!

00:19:50.750 --> 00:19:53.220
You're making a severely injured man testify?!

00:20:00.680 --> 00:20:01.890
Are you ready?

00:20:01.890 --> 00:20:02.820
Go ahead.

00:20:03.480 --> 00:20:06.830
I'm going to separate the video footage and sound that we'll record.

00:20:07.480 --> 00:20:10.940
Then I'll use a program to replace the real voice with a computer generated one,

00:20:10.940 --> 00:20:13.740
causing the original voice to not reach the broadcast.

00:20:15.740 --> 00:20:19.240
It sounds like Chairman Kaishou's voice,

00:20:19.240 --> 00:20:21.990
but it's actually synthesised...

00:20:21.990 --> 00:20:23.620
...is it okay to be doing this?

00:20:23.620 --> 00:20:26.260
We may end up discussing national secrets,

00:20:26.260 --> 00:20:28.970
so I'd like to use a time lag, just in case.

00:20:35.130 --> 00:20:39.220
If Bettennou's ability relies on the use of voice to control people,

00:20:39.220 --> 00:20:42.110
then replacing that voice with an artificial one should cancel it out.

00:20:43.140 --> 00:20:47.810
I didn't think you were the type to have chats with cute little stuffed animals.

00:20:47.810 --> 00:20:49.120
Was that a present from someone?

00:20:51.190 --> 00:20:53.120
I carry it in place of a bag.

00:20:54.940 --> 00:20:56.740
Thank you.

00:20:57.490 --> 00:20:58.200
Sure.

00:20:58.200 --> 00:20:59.870
Just as you suggested,

00:20:59.870 --> 00:21:03.040
when I told him that we should
announce his innocence on live broadcast,

00:21:03.040 --> 00:21:05.130
his daughter helped convince him to go along with it.

00:21:05.130 --> 00:21:08.910
But the conditions you told me to give him...

00:21:08.910 --> 00:21:10.900
What's up with that device in there?

00:21:12.960 --> 00:21:16.170
It's sort of like a good luck charm.

00:21:29.410 --> 00:21:37.460
Wandering hazily on a pale morning, hearing a whispered prayer,

00:21:37.460 --> 00:21:45.420
You and I trace a twisted scenery.

00:21:45.420 --> 00:21:53.100
We're seeking the (truth). "We don't even care if it's a lie."

00:21:53.560 --> 00:21:57.390
As if we can see right through it,

00:21:59.560 --> 00:22:01.440
We follow it along.

00:22:01.440 --> 00:22:05.400
Looking for, going beyond words,

00:22:05.490 --> 00:22:09.410
Like a falling feather.

00:22:09.410 --> 00:22:12.530
Looking for, find it,

00:22:13.410 --> 00:22:18.870
So we can come closer together.

00:22:33.390 --> 00:22:37.390
Looking for, unravel it,

00:22:37.390 --> 00:22:41.400
Tear it apart, like a cloud.

00:22:41.400 --> 00:22:44.480
Looking for, find it,

00:22:45.440 --> 00:22:49.320
So we can come closer together.

00:22:51.610 --> 00:22:55.370
The preview this time is inspired by
"The Red Trap" from Ango Torimonochou as well.

00:22:55.760 --> 00:22:57.610
I'm tired of this pattern!

00:22:57.610 --> 00:22:58.580
It's boring!

00:22:58.580 --> 00:23:01.990
The original idea was a segment of me not being able to read the original story and riffing on the gap,

00:23:01.990 --> 00:23:05.040
and riffing on the gap between it and modern stuff.

00:23:05.040 --> 00:23:10.550
But the scriptwriter has totally forgotten that
and only just remembered now, but it's too late!

00:23:10.550 --> 00:23:12.100
I laid it out straight!

00:23:12.100 --> 00:23:13.430
You got a problem with that?!

00:23:13.430 --> 00:23:16.430
Next time on UN-GO: "Kaishou Rinroku's Funeral".

00:23:16.430 --> 00:23:19.230
Yeah, that's right! He's gonna die!

00:23:19.230 --> 00:23:21.020
You got a problem with that?!
